graph LR
    subgraph User Journey - Browse Ban List
        U1[User opens /banlist] --> U2[Selects format<br/>e.g. Standard]
        U2 --> U3[Sees banned/restricted<br/>cards in grid]
        U3 --> U4{Search or filter?}
        U4 -->|Search| U5[Types card name<br/>debounced 300ms]
        U4 -->|Filter| U6[Clicks status button<br/>All / Banned / Restricted]
        U5 --> U3
        U6 --> U3
    end

    subgraph User Journey - Card Legality
        V1[User views card detail<br/>/collection/:id] --> V2{Card linked?}
        V2 -->|Yes| V3[Legality section loads<br/>from /banlist/card/:id]
        V2 -->|No| V4[Shows 'data not available']
        V3 --> V5[Shows top 6 format badges]
        V5 --> V6{More than 6?}
        V6 -->|Yes| V7[Click 'Show all' to expand]
        V6 -->|No| V8[Done]
        V7 --> V8
    end

    subgraph Admin Journey - Sync
        A1[Admin triggers sync<br/>POST /banlist/sync or CLI] --> A2[Backend downloads<br/>Scryfall NDJSON]
        A2 --> A3[Matches against<br/>local cards]
        A3 --> A4[Detects status changes<br/>appends to history]
        A4 --> A5[Upserts legalities<br/>in card_legalities]
        A5 --> A6[Returns summary]
    end
